    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this spacious detached home, ideally located on the outskirts of Dungarvan Town Centre along the main N25 Cork/Waterford route, and within a 40-minute drive of Waterford City. Beautifully maintained throughout, this delightful home boasts bright, well laid out accommodation perfect for family living. Nestled amidst mature, extensively landscaped gardens, this home enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy, while the generous south-facing patio area provides the perfect setting for outdoor entertaining with family and friends. A spacious driveway ensures ample car parking to the rear. Conveniently located within walking distance of Dungarvan Town Centre, you have an excellent range of amenities including schools, crches, shops, cafs, restaurants, and pubs. Clonea Beach, the Waterford Greenway, along with numerous sporting and recreational facilities, are also close at hand. Both primary and secondary schools are easily accessible on foot or via the nearby cycle track, which also connects directly to the Waterford Greenway. Whatever your needs, this home, more than most, could go a long way towards satisfying the demands of the most discerning purchaser. The bright, well laid out accommodation, extending to 131 sq.m, comprises Entrance Porch, Hallway, Living Room, Sitting Room, Kitchen, Breakfast Room, Utility, 4 Bedrooms, and 2 Bathrooms. REA Spratt highly recommend viewing of this home. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Porch\n1.50m x 1.30m Glazed sliding door\n\nEntrance Hall\n5.80m x 1.50m Carpet floor\n\nSitting Room\n5.60m x 3.85m\nMeasurement excludes bay window. Carpet floor floor with open fire and tiled surround. Overlooking front garden\n\nLiving Room\n3.85m x 3.50m Carpet floor, open fire with wood burning stove. Hot press off\n\nBreakfast Room\n3.60m x 2.60m Carpet floor, generous glazing. Sliding doors leading to south facing patio. High vaulted ceiling with velux light\n\nKitchen\n4.70m x 3.60m Overlooking back garden. Tiled effect lino floor. Generous floor and eye level fitted units with tiled splashback having utility room off\n\nUtility Room\n3.65m x 1.80m Tiled effect lino floor. Fitted units, plumbed for washing machine. Door to rear garden\n\nBedroom 1\n3.80m x 3.35m Overlooking front garden.\nMeasurement excludes bay window and built in wardrobes. Carpet floor\n\nBedroom 2\n3.90m x 3.60m Carpet floor, built in wardrobes incorporating vanity unit\n\nBedroom 3\n3.25m x 2.80m Overlooking front garden. Carpet floor\n\nBathroom\n2.40m x 2.10m Full bathroom suite. Walls fully tiled\n\nBedroom 4\n3.25m x 2.70m Carpet floor\n\nWet Room\n1.95m x 1.50m Fully tiled, Triton T90sr, heated towel rail\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Conveniently positioned detached home of character.\nCar parking to rear of residence available.\nPrivate south facing garden incorporating patio areas.\nGenerous out office perfect for the hobbyist.\nWell proportioned accommodation benefiting from high ceilings.\nThe residence has been well maintained both internally and externally.\nProperty located within walking distance of Dungarvan Town Centre.\nAll floor coverings, all light fittings, all window furnishings and all integrated appliances \n All main services to include water and sewerage\nOil fired central heating\nTelephone and high speed broadband available \n All amenities of Dungarvan Town on the doorstep"
      },
